## Phase 2 — Shell Refactor (Header + Sidebar)

> **Goal:** Modernize the persistent layout chrome before building features that mount into it.

### 2A. Header Refactor

**Current state:** [Header.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Kimo%20Store/Desktop/project-tna/project-a/frontend/tna-project/src/components/shell/Header.tsx) (176 lines)

| Requirement | Action |
|-------------|--------|
| Remove SearchBar | Delete the `shouldShowSearch` logic, the desktop `<form>` (L99-113), and the mobile search bar (L160-173). Remove `MagnifyingGlass` import and `searchQuery`/`isSearching` state. |
| Remove Logo/Text section | Remove the `<Link>` wrapping the logo+title (L76-89). Keep `<div className="w-10" />` as a spacer to preserve relative positioning for the future larger logo. |
| Full responsiveness | Ensure the remaining controls (`LanguageSwitcher`, `NotificationBell`, `UserAvatar`, `WalletBalanceChip`) stack properly on mobile with `flex-wrap` or collapsing to an icon-only mode. |
| Notification Bell click | Wire `<NotificationBell>` `onClick` → open `NotificationPanel` (built in Phase 3). |
| Profile icon click | Wire `<UserAvatar>` `onClick` → navigate to `/${locale}/${role}/profile` or open `ProfileDropdown` (built in Phase 3). |

**Estimated Header after refactor:** ~90 lines.

### 2B. Sidebar Refactor

**Current state:** [RoleSidebar.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Kimo%20Store/Desktop/project-tna/project-a/frontend/tna-project/src/components/layout/RoleSidebar.tsx) (202 lines) + [AppShell.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Kimo%20Store/Desktop/project-tna/project-a/frontend/tna-project/src/components/layout/AppShell.tsx) (122 lines)

#### Collapsed-by-Default

| Step | File | Change |
|------|------|--------|
| 1 | `AppShell.tsx` | Change `useState(false)` → `useState(true)` for `sidebarOpen` on desktop. Add a new `collapsed` state defaulting to `true`. |
| 2 | `AppShell.tsx` | Desktop `<aside>` width transitions: `w-64` (expanded) ↔ `w-[72px]` (collapsed). Add `transition-all duration-300`. |
| 3 | `RoleSidebar.tsx` | Accept `collapsed` prop. When collapsed: hide labels (`<span>` text), show only icons centered. Hide `SidebarProfile` and support section. |
| 4 | `Header.tsx` | The menu toggle button triggers `setCollapsed(!collapsed)` on desktop (≥md) and `setSidebarOpen(!sidebarOpen)` on mobile (<md). |

#### Visual Theme Overhaul

**Remove:** The current `bg-primary-gradient` (blue gradient with low-contrast grey text).

**Replace with:**

```css
/* New sidebar gradient — darker, more professional */
--sidebar-gradient: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1628 0%, #112240 50%, #0d1b3a 100%);

/* Text hierarchy */
--sidebar-text-primary: #e2e8f0;    /* slate-200 */
--sidebar-text-secondary: #94a3b8;  /* slate-400 */
--sidebar-text-muted: #64748b;      /* slate-500 */
--sidebar-active-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
--sidebar-active-border: #38bdf8;   /* sky-400 accent */
--sidebar-hover-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
```

**Active state:** Replace `border-r-2 border-white` → `border-s-3 border-sky-400 bg-white/8` with a subtle left/right glow.

**Files affected:** `RoleSidebar.tsx`, `AppShell.tsx`, possibly `globals.css` for CSS custom properties.

