## Phase 3 — Profile System + Notification System

> **Goal:** Build the two missing interactive systems that the Header icons need.

### 3A. Profile System

**Architecture:**

```
src/
├── components/
│   ├── modules/
│   │   └── profile/
│   │       └── ProfileModule.tsx        # Shared profile renderer
│   └── ui/
│       └── ProfileDropdown.tsx          # Header dropdown (quick actions)
└── app/[locale]/
    ├── visitor/profile/page.tsx         # Already exists
    ├── owner/profile/page.tsx           # CREATE
    ├── carrier/profile/page.tsx         # CREATE
    └── gov/profile/page.tsx             # CREATE
```

**ProfileModule.tsx** — Single component, role-aware:

| Section | Visitor | Owner | Carrier | Gov |
|---------|---------|-------|---------|-----|
| Avatar + Name | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |
| Role Badge | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |
| KYC Status | ✓ | — | — | — |
| Wallet Balance | ✓ | ✓ | — | — |
| Properties Count | — | ✓ | — | — |
| Fleet Size | — | — | ✓ | — |
| Department | — | — | — | ✓ |
| Logout Button | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |

**Sidebar Integration:** Add a "Profile" menu item to `menuConfigs` for Owner, Carrier, and Gov roles (Visitor already has it). Link to `/${role}/profile`.

### 3B. Notification System

**Architecture:**

```
src/
├── components/
│   └── ui/
│       ├── NotificationBell.tsx          # UPDATE: add onClick + panel toggle
│       └── NotificationPanel.tsx         # CREATE: slide-out panel
├── lib/
│   └── mock/
│       └── notifications.mock.ts        # CREATE: role-specific mock data
```

**NotificationPanel.tsx** — Slide-out overlay (not a full page):
- Header: "الإشعارات" + "Mark all read" button
- List: Role-specific mock notifications with timestamps
- Empty state: Illustrated "no notifications" message
- Click handler: Navigate to relevant detail page

**Mock data per role:**

| Role | Sample Notifications |
|------|---------------------|
| Visitor | "Your TNA TNA-001 has been activated", "Shipment SHP-001 is out for delivery" |
| Owner | "New binding request from أحمد الزائر", "Payout of SAR 1,200 processed" |
| Carrier | "New shipment assigned to driver محمد", "Fleet utilization below 50%" |
| Gov | "3 TNA issuance requests pending review", "Policy update requires attention" |

