## Phase 4 — Domain Features

> **Goal:** Complete payment mocking and fix static dashboard widgets.

### 4A. Payment Integration (Checkout Mock Enhancement)

**Current state:** [CheckoutModule.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Kimo%20Store/Desktop/project-tna/project-a/frontend/tna-project/src/components/modules/visitor/CheckoutModule.tsx) has a wallet-based flow but the Top Up modal lacks realistic card entry.

**Enhancement:**

| Component | Change |
|-----------|--------|
| Top Up Modal | Add a "Credit Card" form with fields: Card Number (`4111 1111 1111 1111`), Expiry (`12/28`), CVV (`123`), Cardholder Name. Use `InputField` with masks. |
| Payment Methods | Make the 3 options (Credit Card, Apple Pay, STC Pay) selectable with radio state. Only "Credit Card" opens the form; others show "Coming Soon" badge. |
| Validation | Card number: Luhn check. Expiry: future date. CVV: 3 digits. All required. |
| Success Flow | After top-up, show a brief "SAR {amount} added" toast, update balance, auto-close modal. |
| i18n | Move all hardcoded English strings ("Order Summary", "Pay SAR", etc.) to locale files. |

### 4B. Dashboard Interactivity Audit

**Methodology:** Audit each role's home module for static/placeholder widgets.

| Role | File | Static Widgets | Fix |
|------|------|---------------|-----|
| Owner | `OwnerHomeModule.tsx` | Analytics chart placeholder ("سيتم تفعيل الرسوم البيانية التفاعلية قريباً") | Replace with a simple CSS-only bar chart using mock weekly data from `financials.mock.ts`. |
| Carrier | `CarrierHomeModule.tsx` | Fleet utilization chart, task distribution | Add interactive progress bars with animated fills. Make "خريطة التوزيع" and "دخول الخريطة الحية" buttons navigate to placeholder map pages. |
| Gov | `GovHomeModule.tsx` | Geographic distribution map placeholder | Add a grid of region cards (Riyadh, Jeddah, Dammam, Makkah) with mock request counts and trend arrows. |
| Visitor | `VisitorHomeModule.tsx` | Shipment cards, address cards | Verify click handlers navigate correctly. Add loading skeletons. |

### 4C. Auth Responsivity Fix

**Problem from fixList:** Login page `max-w-[480px]` doesn't scale well. Geometric patterns cause visual clutter on mobile.

**Fix:**
| Breakpoint | Behavior |
|------------|----------|
| `< 640px` (mobile) | Hide geometric background patterns. Full-width card. `px-4`. |
| `640px–1024px` (tablet) | `max-w-[520px]` centered. Subtle patterns at reduced opacity. |
| `> 1024px` (desktop) | `max-w-[480px]` card + full geometric patterns. Split layout option. |

**Files:** `LoginPage.tsx`, `RegistrationModule.tsx`, `ForgotPasswordModule.tsx`.

