## Phase 5 — Testing & QA

> **Goal:** Automated confidence across all roles, locales, and viewports.

### Test Infrastructure Setup

```bash
# Install
npm install -D @playwright/test
npx playwright install

# Config
# playwright.config.ts — baseURL: http://localhost:3000
```

### Test Suite Architecture

```
tests/
├── e2e/
│   ├── auth/
│   │   ├── login.spec.ts
│   │   ├── register.spec.ts
│   │   └── forgot-password.spec.ts
│   ├── visitor/
│   │   ├── home.spec.ts
│   │   ├── checkout.spec.ts
│   │   └── tna-flow.spec.ts
│   ├── owner/
│   │   ├── home.spec.ts
│   │   └── properties.spec.ts
│   ├── carrier/
│   │   └── home.spec.ts
│   └── gov/
│       ├── home.spec.ts
│       └── tna-queue.spec.ts
├── i18n/
│   ├── locale-switching.spec.ts
│   └── rtl-layout.spec.ts
└── responsive/
    └── viewport-matrix.spec.ts
```

### E2E Test Suites

#### Auth Suite (`tests/e2e/auth/`)

| Test | Steps | Assertion |
|------|-------|-----------|
| Login Happy Path | Navigate `/ar/login` → select role → enter creds → submit | Redirected to `/${role}/home` |
| Login Validation | Submit empty form | Error messages visible |
| Forgot Password Flow | Click forgot link → enter email → enter OTP `123456` → set password | Success message shown |
| Register Flow | Navigate `/ar/register` → select type → fill personal → fill account → submit | Redirected to login |
| 404 Regression | Navigate to `/ar/auth/forgot-password` | Should redirect or show proper 404, NOT crash |

#### Gov Queue Suite (`tests/e2e/gov/`)

| Test | Steps | Assertion |
|------|-------|-----------|
| Queue List Loads | Navigate `/ar/gov/tna-queue` | Table renders with pending requests |
| Detail Page Loads | Click "Review" on first row | `/ar/gov/tna-queue/{id}` renders detail view |
| Back Navigation | Click back from detail | Returns to queue list |

#### Checkout Suite (`tests/e2e/visitor/`)

| Test | Steps | Assertion |
|------|-------|-----------|
| Checkout Renders | Navigate with query params `?total=250&tna=TNA-001&type=binding` | Order summary shows SAR 250.00 |
| Insufficient Balance | Set total > balance | "INSUFFICIENT" badge + "Top Up" button visible |
| Top Up Modal | Click "Top Up" → enter card details → submit | Balance increases, modal closes |
| Payment Success | Click "Pay" with sufficient balance | Success screen with redirect |

### i18n Test Suite (`tests/i18n/`)

| Test | Steps | Assertion |
|------|-------|-----------|
| AR→EN Switch | Load `/ar/visitor/home` → switch language | URL changes to `/en/visitor/home`, text is English |
| EN→AR Switch | Load `/en/visitor/home` → switch language | URL changes to `/ar/visitor/home`, text is Arabic |
| RTL Layout | Load `/ar/visitor/home` | `<html dir="rtl">`, sidebar on right |
| LTR Layout | Load `/en/visitor/home` | `<html dir="ltr">`, sidebar on left |
| No Inline Strings | Grep all `.tsx` files | Zero `isRTL ? '...' : '...'` patterns |

### Responsive Test Suite (`tests/responsive/`)

Test matrix across 3 viewports:

| Viewport | Width | Key Assertions |
|----------|-------|---------------|
| Mobile | 375px | Bottom nav visible, sidebar hidden, hamburger menu works |
| Tablet | 768px | Sidebar collapsed, header responsive |
| Desktop | 1440px | Sidebar expanded, full header controls |

**Pages to test per viewport:** Login, Visitor Home, Owner Home, Gov Queue, Checkout.

### CI Integration

```yaml
# .github/workflows/test.yml
name: E2E Tests
on: [push, pull_request]
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with: { node-version: 20 }
      - run: npm ci
      - run: npx playwright install --with-deps
      - run: npm run build
      - run: npx playwright test
      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
        if: failure()
        with:
          name: playwright-report
          path: playwright-report/
```

