## Execution Timeline

| Phase | Est. Effort | Dependencies |
|-------|------------|--------------|
| **Phase 1:** Routing + i18n | 3-4 hours | None |
| **Phase 2:** Header + Sidebar | 2-3 hours | Phase 1 (i18n keys ready) |
| **Phase 3:** Profile + Notifications | 3-4 hours | Phase 2 (shell has click handlers) |
| **Phase 4:** Payments + Dashboards | 3-4 hours | Phase 1 (i18n), Phase 3 (profile pages exist) |
| **Phase 5:** Playwright Testing | 2-3 hours | All phases complete |

**Total estimated effort:** 13–18 hours

---

## Risk Register

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|
| i18n key extraction misses edge cases | Phase 5 includes automated grep test for inline strings |
| Sidebar collapse breaks mobile overlay | Test both states at every viewport in Phase 5 |
| Gov detail page mock data mismatch | Verify `request_id` format matches between mock and router |
| Payment mock gives false confidence | Add clear "DEMO MODE" banner on checkout in dev |

